    class KServeCtrl,ODHModelCtrl,MaaS,GAIE,Dashboard,DSPipelines,ModelReg,KueueCtrl,TrainingOp,CodeFlareOp,KubeRayOp,TrustyAIOp,AgentsOp platform
    class InfSvc,LLMdPods,NotebookPods,TrainingPods,PipelinePods user
